# Prisma

- Prisma stays in infrastructure. Domain entities must not import Prisma types.
- Use Prisma 7 with `@prisma/adapter-pg`.
- Inspect generated SQL before applying migrations.
- Never reset a non-test database without explicit authorization.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/create-prisma-migration/SKILL.md`.
